  m_text: '<color=orange>DATA:</color>

    This weapon uses energy accumulated from
    shooting enemies to fire several shots at once.


    <color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>

    -
    Every other shot from a revolver will charge this weapon by 0.5. If the shot
    comes from a <color=orange>FAN FIRE</color> revolver, it instead charges it by
    one.


    - The default version fires one shot every 0.15 seconds. This cannot
    be sped up.


    - The alternate version fires one shot every 0.25 seconds.
    However, it temporarily replaces your primary fire, and there is no cooldown.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e17c1171f4f8d2943b623111fe56e09f, type: 2}
